<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Movie Gallery cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Movie Gallery cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns cut its rating for Movie Gallery Inc to neutral from attractive, a source at the brokerage said Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off 33/64 to 5-1/8 at mid-morning.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
